  "limitations": [
    "Complete qualification requires separately observed successful make verify-exec-06 execution on the clean committed candidate and its external source-bound record; the short audit and wrapper controls are not execution authentication.",
    "Retention logically erases eligible fields, not SQLite pages, WAL, snapshots or backups. Backlog and recovery exclusions prevent a deletion SLA; retained operational identities and replay digests remain pseudonymous.",
    "SQLite and deterministic mock integrations are the required local target. Optional PostgreSQL skips are not runtime qualification; no real external delivery or production identity is established.",
    "Metrics are bounded process-local best-effort diagnostics, reset on restart, and never replace durable audit authority. Structured redaction is not arbitrary free-text DLP.",
    "This does not complete DEL-01, EXEC-07 clean-state acceptance, EXEC-08 final attestation or a new kernel-isolated AC-15 four-suite run. Any separately performed run must be identified by its own observed evidence.",
    "CI stays disabled. No Docker setting, network check, coverage threshold, suite inventory or existing deadline is weakened; all checkpoint branches are preserved and main is not rewritten."
  ]
